            <h1>Systemic Therapy and Counseling</h1>
            <p class="rd-lead">Systemic therapy and counseling is aimed at people with deep-seated wishes for change. For stressful situations, inner or outer conflicts or recurring problems, new ways of coping can be developed. Your own strengths and abilities can be activated and your own influence expanded. Additional room to maneuver can emerge on the cognitive, emotional and social level.</p>
            <p class="hero-note"><strong>Important note:</strong> My services are not psychotherapy and not medical treatment. In acute crises, please turn to medical or psychotherapeutic services: <a href="#faq-krise">Where to turn in acute crises</a>.</p>
            <nav class="page-jump" aria-label="On this page"><span class="page-jump-label">On this page</span><div class="page-jump-list"><a href="#arbeitsverstaendnis">Systemic</a><a href="#arbeitsweise">Approach</a><a href="#angebote">Services</a><a href="#faq">FAQ</a><a href="#kontakt">Contact</a></div></nav>
