    <section class="snap-section rd-sec rd-ez" id="arbeitsverstaendnis" data-index="1">
      <div class="about-band offers-band"></div>
      <div class="rd-inner">
        <div class="rd-eyebrow">Systemic Therapy &amp; Counseling</div>
        <div class="rd-cols">
          <div class="rd-clamp rd-col rd-text c1"><h2>The systemic view: seeing people in their contexts</h2><p>Systemic therapy and counseling widens the focus from the individual person to their relationships and living circumstances. Our experience is strongly shaped by experiences with important attachment figures and by the environments in which we move.</p><p>Systemic approaches make it possible to bring couples, families or other people involved into conversation beyond the individual setting. In individual sessions, we talk about your relationships with important people and about the circumstances that matter for your concerns.</p><button class="rd-readmore" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="faq-toggle"></span><span class="rd-readmore-t">Read more</span></button></div>
          <div class="rd-clamp rd-col rd-text c2"><h2>My professional understanding: patterns as attempts at solutions</h2><p>Unpleasant states and distressing behaviors are, as a rule, attempts at a solution. They arose in stressful situations and earlier relationships, had protective functions back then, and today usually run involuntarily under tension, often with unwanted side effects.</p><p>In a supportive framework, I help you to notice such patterns consciously and to explore the needs and themes connected with them. With regard to communication and relationship dynamics, clarity and a new sense of fit can emerge. Alongside accepting what cannot be changed, room for action can be expanded and more well-being developed.</p><button class="rd-readmore" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="faq-toggle"></span><span class="rd-readmore-t">Read more</span></button></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="snap-section rd-sec rd-tint rd-ez" id="arbeitsweise" data-index="2">
      <div class="about-band offers-band"></div>
      <div class="rd-inner">
        <div class="rd-eyebrow">My approach</div>
        <div class="rd-cols">
          <div class="rd-clamp rd-col rd-text c1"><h2>Outside impulses for new perspectives</h2><p>We all have blind spots, because most of our inner processes run unconsciously. It takes feedback from trusted people and a professional outside perspective to make them visible and make development possible.</p><p>I bring in observations, questions and suggestions that you can examine, take up or reject. In our shared process, we take time so that you can mindfully notice what feels right for you and which changes you want to steer toward.</p><button class="rd-readmore" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="faq-toggle"></span><span class="rd-readmore-t">Read more</span></button></div>
          <div class="rd-col rd-text c2"><h2>Approaches and methods in my work</h2>
            <div class="rd-chipgroup">
              <span class="rd-chipgroup-label">Approaches</span>
              <div class="rd-chips">
                <span class="rd-chip">systemic-constructivist</span>
                <span class="rd-chip">growth-oriented</span>
                <span class="rd-chip">hypnosystemic</span>
                <span class="rd-chip is-key">solution-focused</span>
                <span class="rd-chip is-key">short-term</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="rd-chipgroup">
              <span class="rd-chipgroup-label">Methods as needed and depending on the assignment</span>
              <div class="rd-chips">
                <span class="rd-chip">working with inner parts</span>
                <span class="rd-chip">body-oriented</span>
                <span class="rd-chip">imaginative</span>
                <span class="rd-chip">mindfulness-based</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p>Starting from your goals, we develop helpful perspectives, desired ways of experiencing and concrete next steps. As many sessions take place as make sense for your concerns.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

